text=['# Complete output hashes and differential results','','Generated from `evidence/results.json`; every LUM hash covers65,536 bytes, every gamma hash covers2,560 bytes. Individual256-byte gamma-row hashes are in the JSON. The original code uses the named substituted CRT services; these are not certified retail DLL outputs.','','| Context / CW / power service | Complete LUM SHA-256 | Complete gamma SHA-256 |','|---|---|---|']
for c in x['cases']:text.append('| '+c['case']+' | `'+c['lum_sha256']+'` | `'+c['gamma_sha256']+'` |')
text+=['','Power suffix0=glibc double pow,1=glibc extended powl. CW values are in case names as four hex digits. All20 cases have zero native-versus-rational LUM mismatches, zero native-versus-independent-C mismatches, and zero original-conversion-sequence mismatches. Each power trace contains all2,560 pairs of input operands and returned values; surrounding rational arithmetic verifies every operand and stored byte.','','| Counterfactual on permuted palette | Different LUM bytes |','|---|---|']
for d in x['counterfactuals']:text.append('| '+d['variant']+' | '+str(d['different_bytes'])+' |')
text+=['','| Retail LUM resource | Different bytes from conditional generation |','|---|---|']
for d in retail:text.append('| '+d['resource']+' | '+str(d['different_bytes'])+' |')
text+=['','Resource differences use unmodified ACT bytes installed in a supplied context. They do not establish resource authoring methods or output under a particular corrected backend. Runtime tables and resource payloads remain private.','','The published Ghidra comparisons include full original generator return and65,536 stores for permuted/tie/retail m05, plus a PC24 arithmetic control. PC64 power-operand and byte comparisons pass. Under PC24, native-service replay has2,556 mismatched original input pairs, despite equal final bytes; that replay must not be called architectural parity. The separate fixed-PC64 replay control returns identical gamma hashes for emulated CW037F and007F, exposing that Ghidra ignores these precision bits. Native CW007F with its own service differs in167 gamma bytes.']
(R/'artifacts/RESULTS.md').write_text('\n'.join(text)+'\n')
print('Curated',len(x['cases']),'native cases and',len(comparisons),'Ghidra cases')
